        <mxCell id="mcu" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12px;text-align:left;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AI8051U-34K64&lt;/b&gt;  LQFP48&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5  P4.7   nRST（复位键）&lt;br&gt;6  P3.0   USB D−&lt;br&gt;8  P3.1   USB D+&lt;br&gt;9  P3.2   KEY_ENTER&lt;br&gt;10 P3.3   KEY_BACK&lt;br&gt;13 P3.6   KEY_UP&lt;br&gt;14 P3.7   KEY_DOWN&lt;br&gt;15 P5.6   XTALO&lt;br&gt;16 P5.7   XTALI&lt;br&gt;17 GND&lt;br&gt;22 P2.3   SDA&lt;br&gt;23 P2.4   SCL&lt;br&gt;24 P5.0   BUZZ&lt;br&gt;29 UCAP&lt;br&gt;41 VCC&lt;br&gt;43 P1.0   ENC_A&lt;br&gt;44 P1.1   ENC_B&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其余引脚空置：&lt;br&gt;1 2 3 4 7 11 12 18–21&lt;br&gt;25–28 30–40 42 45–48&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="c2">
